<p style="line-height:1.656; margin-top:16px; margin-bottom:16px"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Hi {{{Recipient.FirstName}}},</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Top-performing agencies achieve consistent quarterly results by adopting a core strategy: they avoid treating every lead the same.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Some prospects are ready to buy today, while others are just starting their search. The most successful agencies prioritize the right opportunities and follow up efficiently when it matters most, utilizing strategies and tools designed for this purpose.</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
&nbsp;

<p style="line-height:1.38"><span style="font-size:10.5pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#000000"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">For a synthesis of best practices that top agents use to maximize performance with inbound insurance leads, check out our guide:</span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

